# Files kept in the repository but not shipped to pub.dev.
#
# IMPORTANT: `.pubignore` *replaces* `.gitignore` for packaging — pub stops
# consulting `.gitignore` entirely once this file exists, so every build
# artifact must be repeated here or it lands in the archive. Omitting
# `rust/target/` once packaged 2.6 GB of Rust build output.
#
# Keep the published archive to: Dart sources, Rust sources (so consumers can
# rebuild the native library), prebuilt binaries, and docs.

# Rust build output. `rust/fuzz/` covers its own target/, corpus/ and
# artifacts/ subdirectories.
rust/target/
rust/fuzz/

# Dart tooling and lockfile.
.dart_tool/
.packages
pubspec.lock

# Editor and IDE state.
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml

# CI-only: these drive the build pipeline, never the installed package.
.github/
tool/
